Color [Connector]
To set the color of the Connector, click the field next to Color.
Remarks
You can select one of the predefined colors or you can click More Colors and click the Select button to
select a color in the color matrix. Then click OK. Plant Simulation shows this color next to More Colors and
uses it as the active color.
